  "description": "Take a long drink of cool trails on the Shift S3, a full-featured Shift / Trail bike at a refreshing price point. Sharing the same hydroformed tubing and front triangle as the rest of the Shift family, the Shift S3 opts for a simple and easy-to-maintain single pivot suspension design. Enjoy 120mm of front and rear travel with a Suntour Raidon fork, new X-Fusion rear shock, 2x10 Deore drivetrain, Tektro hydraulic disc brakes, internal down tube cable routing, and Suntour XCM 2-pc crankset.\n6061-T6 alloy single pivot frame, 120mm rear travel, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 9mm Q/R rear dropouts\nX-Fusion 02 Pro R rear shock w/ adjustable rebound\nSR Raidon-XC-LO-R fork, tapered alloy steerer, 120mm travel, air spring w/ hydraulic lockout\nSuntour XCM 38/24T crankset w/ 24mm Axle, 10-spd compatible\nShimano Deore front & rear derailleur + shifters\nShimano Deore 10-spd 11-36T cassette\nLight Weinmann U-26 disc rims\nPivit alloy cockpit with 0 Deg. Trail stem",
